Subject: [PATCH 6/9] NTimeDiagonalizer: the main machine; exists_queryTM
 proved
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

`qy_main` proves `hmain`: the main machine `qyM₁ κ` computes the query on the unary word of
every input's length within `qyMainA κ · (g n + 1)` steps. On inputs of length `n ≥ 3` it hosts
the setup, the locator and the writer its escape selects, run to the halt (`qy_main_long`); on
`n ≤ 2` the setup's short path and the empty emission (`qy_main_short`). The initial
configuration is the blank seam at the setup's entry (`qy_initCfg`). `exists_queryTM`'s body is
now `exact qy_main hf hg` after the landed `suffices`; its axioms are
`[propext, Classical.choice, Quot.sound]`. The Implementation status paragraph records the
proof.

